# IMX round 4: the project random seed. Seed 7 is set, track 1 holds eight steps with Chance 50 %, Play runs twice (stop and start in between). A seeded Play restarts the same random stream (resetChanceState), so the order of the first note ons of the two takes is the same
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini  (setup pokes in plus_flows.sh, the poke trace UISHOT_TRACE_FFSTATE is the read, poke_ok in plus_flows.sh)
title: random seed (Tracker Mini, IMX round 4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
tap Fn1
wait 3000ms
tap Play
wait 5000ms
shot seed-playing
tap Play
wait 1500ms
shot seed-stopped
wait 800ms
tap Play
wait 5000ms
shot seed-playing2
tap Play
wait 1500ms
shot seed-stopped2
